ted midnight time applies to the bar.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"olivias-gettysburg","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Olivia's","title":"The Baltimore Pike Dinner Run","subtitle":"Mediterranean food with 11 p.m. weekend hours","notes":"Make this a planned car trip five miles south of center square, and call ahead if arriving near the Friday or Saturday cutoff.","short_summary":"A longer off-campus dinner run with the board's latest full-service weekend hours.","evidence_claim":"Olivia's official website lists hours until 11 p.m. Friday–Saturday, 10 p.m. Tuesday–Thursday, and 9 p.m. Sunday at 3015 Baltimore Pike.","source_url":"https://www.oliviasgettysburg.com/","source_title":"Olivia's in Gettysburg","source_kind":"business_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The restaurant lists 11 p.m. closing Friday–Saturday, 10 p.m. Tuesday–Thursday, 9 p.m. Sunday, and Monday closure.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":["Hours can change for holidays, weather, seasonal operations, or academic breaks; verify the linked official page immediately before departure.","Several York Road and Baltimore Pike destinations are vehicle-oriented and are not represented as safe or practical walking trips from campus."]}],"warnings":[]}
